{%- comment -%} NIP-05 for this site's domain: names the Nostr key in cv.yaml "_",
which Nostr apps show as the bare domain, so a Nostr profile whose NIP-05
address is this domain shows it. As a static file it can't read the ?name=
query, so every name gets this one answer {%- endcomment -%}
